    {
      "id": "overall_plan",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "role: plan\nproject: resource_library\n\nCreate a phased research plan to identify concrete, well-scoped R&D objectives for extending the Mark-XLVIII assistant platform. This plan will be reviewed before any execution begins.",
