    {
      "id": "evidence_mark_platform",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "role: evidence\nproject: mark_platform\n\nRead the Mark-XLVIII platform's real source code read-only (project_operator learn_project) so the self-assessment step has genuine, file-grounded evidence instead of a guess.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "deliverables": [
        "Real, file-grounded takeaways about Mark-XLVIII's actual subsystems, sourced from project_operator learn_project"
      ],
