          }
        }
      },
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "self_assessment",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "role: research\n\nUsing ONLY the real, file-grounded evidence already provided below (from a completed, read-only scan of the Mark-XLVIII source -- you do not need to read or scan anything yourself), enumerate its major subject areas/subsystems. Do not guess or rely on generic assumptions about what a typical AI assistant platform contains; if the evidence does not support a claim, leave it out rather than filling the gap with a plausible-sounding guess. If the evidence below is limited to scan metadata only (a root path, a snapshot hash, a file count) with no real descriptive content about what the code actually does, say so explicitly as a single-line caveat instead of treating that metadata itself as if it were a subject area.\n\nDeliverables:\n- List of concrete subject areas grounded in the provided evidence, or an explicit caveat that the evidence was too thin to enumerate them\n\n<!-- jarvis-forward-scout: do not edit below this line -->\n> **Context from `evidence_mark_platform_8146ff`:** - The canonical project root is `F:\\Mark-XLVIII-main`.\n- The current repository snapshot is `1f86e8cba90bebd0507eb0ae1cfe0db670e9b66ad768d175c1178e7b46749ec4`.\n- JARVIS read 36 selected files and skipped 4 sensitive files.\n> **Context from `overall_plan_ec8453`:** Create a phased research plan to identify concrete, well-scoped R&D objectives for extending the Mark-XLVIII assistant platform. This plan will be reviewed before any execution begins.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "deliverables": [
        "List of concrete subject areas derived directly from the code"
      ],
      "jarvis": {
        "layout_profile": "dependency",
        "layout_baseline": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 320,
          "width": 420,
          "height": 180
        },
        "kind": "plan_step",
        "step_id": "self_assessment_ad3289",
        "workflow_id": "mark_rd_scouting",
        "run_id": "mark_rd_scouting-v7",
        "step_state": "ACCEPTED",
        "attempt": 1,
        "updated_at": "2026-09-24T21:08:05Z",
        "scout_context": {
          "overall_plan_ec8453": {
            "summary": "Create a phased research plan to identify concrete, well-scoped R&D objectives for extending the Mark-XLVIII assistant platform. This plan will be reviewed before any execution begins.",
