            "summary": "Caveat: The provided evidence contains only scan metadata (a root path, a repository snapshot hash, and file read/skip counts) with no descriptive content about what the code does. Therefore, subject areas cannot be enumerated.\n\nNo subject-area list is provided because the evidence does not support any claim about the platform's actual subsystems.",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-24T21:08:05Z"
          }
        }
